-- src:24 | reference means a reference to the Tax Court of Canada pursuant to subsection 28(2) of the Act; (renvoi)
@ref C.R.C., c. 1246, reg 2(1) "reference" (src:24)
GIVEN `the proceeding is a reference to the Tax Court of Canada pursuant to subsection 28(2) of the Act` IS A BOOLEAN
